# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo publishes ONLY the static archive in docs/.
#
# The UpdraftPlus backup material below is deliberately excluded: the database
# dump contains the WordPress user account, a password hash, and security /
# audit logs, and the plugin + theme trees are third-party GPL source that has
# no place in a public archive repo. Keep these locally / in private backup.
#
# NOTE: every pattern is anchored with a leading "/" so it matches ONLY at the
# repository root. Unanchored ("uploads/") would also match
# docs/wp-content/uploads/ and silently strip the site's images and theme CSS.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/database/
/plugins/
/themes/
/mu-plugins/
/uploads/
/backup_*/

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

# conversion log — kept locally, not published with the archive
/ARCHIVE-REPORT.md

# scratch
*.bak
/docs.bak/

# local tool config (also covered by the global gitignore; pinned here so it
# holds for any clone of this repo)
.claude/settings.local.json
